   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "softirq 不是可调度实体，借被打断任务的上下文跑，且 preempt_count ≠ 0；睡眠会把无关任务挂起，内核报 scheduling while atomic",
   "originalText": "softirq 不是可调度实体，借被打断任务的上下文跑，且 preempt_count ≠ 0；睡眠会把无关任务挂起，内核报 scheduling while atomic",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
