   "text": "net/core/dev.c          net_rx_action()\ninclude/linux/interrupt.h  接口\ninclude/linux/preempt.h    计数字段\nkernel/softirq.c           触发、入口、核心",
   "originalText": "net/core/dev.c          net_rx_action()\ninclude/linux/interrupt.h  接口\ninclude/linux/preempt.h    计数字段\nkernel/softirq.c           触发、入口、核心",
